  "keyFeatures": [
    "Declarative YAML-based package build configuration",
    "Pipeline-oriented builds with full control over every build step",
    "Multi-architecture builds via QEMU emulation (x86_64, aarch64, armv7, etc.)",
    "Built-in pipelines for popular ecosystems: Go, Rust/Cargo, Python, Ruby, Maven, npm, Perl",
    "Integrated package signing with RSA keys",
    "Post-build linting to catch common packaging mistakes",
    "Built-in test framework using the same pipeline DSL",
    "Build cache support for Go modules, pip, npm, Composer, Maven, and uv",
    "SLSA provenance generation",
    "SBOM (Software Bill of Materials) generation",
    "Integration with apko for building minimal OCI container images",
    "Custom pipeline support via --pipeline-dir flag"
  ],
